      "summary": "Adds support for eval cases built from shallow repos. A new fetch-pr.sh makes a shallow repo holding the merge base, the head and the commits between them. make-case.sh writes a `shallow` file into the case. cloneCase uses that file to init an empty repo with the shallow marks and fetch the bundle into it, since git refuses to clone such a bundle. Tests, docs and version bumps to 0.3.1 are included."
